/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 163 0 R
/T (Sustainability starts with the everyday choices. UNIZG FOI encourages students, staff and partners to adopt simple habits that reduce their negative environmental impact to contribute to a greener community. These recommendations range from saving energy and water, reducing waste, using resources responsibly, choosing sustainable transport, reducing digital waste, to taking part in volunteering and sustainability initiatives. Small changes can make a meaningful difference. Discover what you can do, turn awareness into action, and share your ideas to inspire positive change across the community.)
